Project and packaging: ImAthanasia.

Firmware is built from OpenWrt (GPL-2.0) with flatstik's AC-PHY b43 work
(branch b43-ac-phy of https://github.com/flatstik/AC66U_B1), which in turn
builds on aleferri/b43-ac-wip. The in-router page, docs, build scripts and
images in this repository are MIT licensed (see LICENSE); binder/firmware
binaries distributed through Releases remain under their upstream licenses.

Hardware read-back data (PHY table 0x0a, phyreg 0x040a = 0x0532) was captured
on this unit with the wl-mmio-trap and is published in
https://github.com/aleferri/b43-ac-wip/issues/50.
